        <h1>Artificial Intelligence for Tracking Micro-Behaviors in Longitudinal Data and Predicting Their Effect on Well-Being and Team Performance</h1>
        <div class="meta-id">Record ID: 80NSSC22K0775</div>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <div class="action-banner">
          <div class="action-banner-text">
            <strong>Official Source:</strong> National Aeronautics and Space Administration Life Sciences Data Archive
          </div>
          <a href="https://nlsp.nasa.gov/search/data/details/25e25479-2a09-5e09-847a-f1aa30f5b11a?dataType=EXPERIMENTS" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">
            View Official Record on NASA NLSP &rarr;
